    "description": "Type II High Bias Cassettes - Lot of 6\nTDK, Sony, & Fuji Audiocassettes\nVintage 1990s Blank Audio Tapes\nCollection of six vintage Type II high bias blank cassette tapes produced in the late 1990s. Designed for high-fidelity recording from CD sources, these Type II formulations feature high output and low tape hiss, making them enduring favorites among audiophiles and tape recording enthusiasts.\nItems Included:\n1.\nTDK SA 90\n- 90-min Super Avilyn Type II cassette, sealed.\n2.\nSony CD-IT 100\n- 100-min Type II cassette, slim case, sealed.\n3.\nSony CD-IT 100\n- 100-min Type II cassette, slim case, sealed.\n4.\nFuji Z II 90\n- 90-min Type II cassette, Extraslim case, sealed.\n5.\nFuji Z II 90\n- 90-min Type II cassette, Extraslim case, sealed.\n6.\nFuji Z II 90\n- 90-min Type II cassette, Extraslim case, sealed.\nCondition:\nAll six cassette tapes are brand new and factory sealed in original manufacturer packaging. Cellophane wrap shows light exterior shelf wear and minor scuffing from storage. No tears or holes in the wrapping.",
